{
  "loads": true,
  "name": "lsp-merger",
  "nameSource": "manifest",
  "lspServers": [
    {
      "key": "go",
      "command": "/opt/gopls",
      "args": [
        "serve"
      ],
      "extensionToLanguage": {
        ".go": "go"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "pyright",
      "command": "pyright-langserver",
      "args": [
        "--stdio"
      ],
      "extensionToLanguage": {
        ".py": "python"
      }
    }
  ],
  "basis": "PLG:322-323 .lsp.json 先、清单声明按序，同名服务器后者取代；CMP:876 同规则；CMP:867 .lsp.json 直接是「服务器名 → 配置」的映射，没有包裹对象"
}
